      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Avoca%2C_Indiana",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Avoca State Fish Hatchery, built in 1819 as a grist mill, became a fish hatchery in 1923 and stocked Indiana waters until 2013.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
