      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Indiana State Road 37 runs along the eastern edge of Avoca, leading north 19 miles to Bloomington and south 6 miles to Bedford.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
